## Context
Child 3 of tracker 1100 (about 3.5 agent-h, 0.5 author-h). Plan of record: docs/discussions/2026-10-14-1096-design.md. Retires `review-pr` in one merge wave once child 0's project PRs are merged and gaze (child 2) has absorbed its code panel.

## Scope (from the 1100 plan table)
Move what remains of review-pr, fix its `IDH_ROOT` handling, update hunt and references, add the retired-name lint over live paths (fails on any live reference to `review-pr`), installed-link cleanup, and a read-only audit of installed registrations. No alias.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `review-pr` is retired with no alias and the retired-name lint fails on any live reference
- [ ] Installed links to the retired name are removed on padme and doudou; the read-only audit of installed registrations is reported
- [ ] Child 0's project PRs are merged first
- [ ] Catalog regenerated and drift check clean; PR under the 15-file breaker, else split

## Added 2026-10-21 (from folded ticket 1171)
- [ ] Seats run only targeted tests of the files the diff touches (`/gaze`, the adherence seat,
      `/verify-gate`); none of them runs the full suite. The full suite runs once, on the merge candidate,
      in the gate. Say it once, in the review skill that survives; callers point to it.
